  "description": "Replace single pitched roof on existing two storey rear extension with double pitched roof, undertake alterations to internalise staircase and remove staircase overrun to facilitate a 3 bedroom flat and retain second floor dormer window.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The rear roof dormer, due to its design, massing and lack of setbacks, is considered a poor quality feature that would fail to integrate with the property and sit comfortably within the existing roofscape. This is considered contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policy D3 Policy of the London Plan (2021); CS.1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Plan Local Policies (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
